  <title>Shipping history</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Reports</gui><gui>Shipping history</gui></guiseq>, or
  <gui>Shipping history</gui> in <link xref="shipping_info"/>, lists every
  shipment recorded, with its invoice, contact, what the carrier charged and
  the date shipped. Type into <gui>Tracking number</gui>, <gui>Invoice</gui>
  or <gui>Contact</gui> to find one. <gui>Refresh</gui> is in the window
  menu.</p>

  <p>Check <gui>Edit mode</gui> in the window menu, which asks for the
  administrator password, to right click a shipment and <gui>Edit Incoming
  Invoice</gui>, the carrier's bill for it; see <link
  xref="incoming_invoice_edit"/>.</p>

</page>
